      "title": "Historical Z-Score vs. Isolation Forest Anomaly Score (Bivariate Decision Space)",
      "type": "xychart",
      "pluginVersion": "11.5.2",
      "description": "Bivariate decision space comparing statistical Z-Score departures against Isolation Forest scores (Review candidate subset, n=100)",
